    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk, i'm not really feeling nauseous or anything, just that annoying ache on the right side. it doesn't feel like an emergency, just really distracting. i'm pretty sure it's just something i ate earlier that's not sitting right. if i take the advil now, can i just wait until morning to see if it goes away? i'd rather just deal with it at home so i don't waste money on a doctor for no reason.",
